r print.png", "id": "246912787875696", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/39031311_246912791209029_5540108180063733703_n.png?_nc_cat=108&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=dQ218tQDMt4Q7kNvwE6fi3e&_nc_oc=Adp8_KuuwUY78nJfaLYyZWiVqA-dLgl39LDwUpxOuWt5LHuuP3bmN86sNMwx50Jdld0&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQAdUcVoS297-GJBYC0_aNW8e--mq948n6aLTFT_85gSGg&oe=6A4FB2EE"}, {"file_name": "Print 3.png", "id": "2170405556482566", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/57572950_2170405559815899_5420058398011207589_n.png?_nc_cat=108&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=64KZUtRZbt4Q7kNvwFfeU6M&_nc_oc=AdrcSXxEwZ_EF63pCjQ5UkJmIGJ05ilvcfziZgsSKJx6eJg4rPvBy6Fk7rMJ5t72xQI&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQDVlWY7bqFIsKMeFb4-nGMLZ4cEgaRYAEsDMAb_6T868Q&oe=6A4F8C6F"}, {"file_name": "Print 5.png", "id": "921050275807580", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38974548_921050279140913_846272164452751718_n.png?_nc_cat=104&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=5t9fMowLj9kQ7kNvwHGWsdj&_nc_oc=AdoNCMK0FK-S-dI8RKvf-mQsqVqqXpahjlRoYQAR-PvbPQ80-eyfveYOY4NPefVqM6s&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQASlBgALz0gS5ZkgpaRaz4vlxTvnrF0iQ9e2-ueR5ficQ&oe=6A4FB797"}, {"file_name": "Print 2.png", "id": "1288706015050300", "uri": "https://scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/75641339_1288706018383633_3836298053771559642_n.png?_nc_cat=102&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=LH5PNIzJslQQ7kNvwEDY8JW&_nc_oc=AdqJPkz2rQtYRsnRn8B1cGjaV_Qz16I9PYUtbOW7uaeT_QSIZZp3JhZ5RXqOFz1nRus&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQCU-Azy_aQWo6tauis-9p7f9_yNO4OzeLxDlsSJt4isUg&oe=6A4FC151"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "Final v.0.1 (eeve).png", "id": "945385240225978", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38974721_945385243559311_50820886768660782_n.png?_nc_cat=104&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=ZvdXH1W0BQAQ7kNvwHijG_e&_nc_oc=AdowbxBezqolRPVDJoZkFCeSkfIu5u22jIMDwAlw4gCt__QGaqI6Emvgl4m_ym6b2ts&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQD-MGAs4dieHqDUIprJcfIsfEhq2l3OHqt6Go-DuBRseA&oe=6A4F8EBC"}, "display_name": "My Room", "keywords": [], "long_description": "My Room is the game experience that allows you to interact with your friends and also create your own world.\n\nCustomize your character and explore our two game modes: Playground & My Room.\n\nIn the Playground you will find yourself in a multiplayer environment surrounded by minigames that are available to play with others. These games include:\n- Soccer: score as many goals as you can\n- Air Hockey (Arcade): play with the AI or with another player\n- Basketball (Arcade): throw the balls and try to score points\n- Cornhole (Arcade): have fun trying to score as you play with the bean bags\n- Darts (Arcade): practice your aiming in the available stations\n- Mini Golf (Arcade): try to aim the hole at the mini golf courses\nThe multiplayer also includes voice/text chat for you to communicate with other players\n\nWhen in My Room, you will be able to customize your own space. You can choose between 3 different themed templates, explore and change it the way you prefer.\n\n* Find more information about the gameplay itself the app*\n\nUpcoming updates in the near future:\n- Game monetary system\n- Shop\n- More games\n- More rooms\n\nHave fun!", "short_description": "Play minigames along with your friends in a multiplayer environment or explore and customize your own room with this experience."}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://vresearchlab.com/privacy-policy/", "developer_terms_of_service_url": "https://vresearchlab.com/terms-of-use/", "publisher_name": "VResearch Lab", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "https://vresearchlab.com/", "category": null, "comfort_rating": "NOT_RATED", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": null, "context_topics": [], "ex